; USER32.DEF
;
; The functions the Windows 98 SE / Me build may import from USER32.dll:
; the import library is made from this list (llvm-dlltool -k), and
; tools/win9x_check.py fails a linked image that imports anything else.
;
; Each name here is exported and implemented by the USER32 of Windows 98
; Second Edition and of Windows Me: Windows 95 functions, ANSI versions only
; (9x implements none of USER32's W functions but MessageBoxW and a few
; text ones, which the build does not use). wsprintfA is cdecl.

LIBRARY USER32.dll
EXPORTS
AdjustWindowRect@12
AdjustWindowRectEx@16
BeginPaint@8
ChangeDisplaySettingsA@8
CharLowerA@4
CharUpperA@4
ClientToScreen@8
ClipCursor@4
CloseClipboard@0
