GetKeyState@4
GetMessageA@16
GetSystemMetrics@4
GetWindowLongA@8
GetWindowRect@8
InvalidateRect@12
IsClipboardFormatAvailable@4
IsIconic@4
IsWindowVisible@4
KillTimer@8
LoadCursorA@8
LoadIconA@8
